{
    "title": "EVgo - Fast EV Charging",
    "description": "<b>Find a Fast EV Charger with EVgo</b>\r\nFinding a charger has never been easier! With the EVgo app, you can find over 1,000 fast charging stations across 35 states. Whether you're at home, work, or on the go, the EVgo app helps you find EV chargers near you, get real-time availability, and access directions\u2014all in just a few taps. Join more than 1 million drivers who trust EVgo for fast, reliable electric vehicle (EV) charging, anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Find EV Charging Stations Near You: Easily find the nearest EV chargers with our interactive EV charging map. Whether you're looking for a Tesla, CCS Combo, or CHAdeMO connectors, EVgo\u2019s public charging network has a charger for your vehicle.\r\n\u2022 Real-Time Charger Availability: Save time by checking the real-time availability of charging stations before you arrive.\r\n\u2022 Get Directions: The EVgo app seamlessly integrates with your favorite navigation apps, allowing you to get step-by-step directions to your selected charging station.\r\n\u2022 Filter by Connector Type & Charging Speed: Searching for a specific charger type? Filter results by connector type (Tesla, CHAdeMO, CCS) and charging speed to find the right charger for your EV.\r\n\u2022 Reserve Your Charger: In select locations, you can even reserve your charging spot ahead of time, ensuring that a charger will be waiting for you when you arrive. Use the EVgo app to find chargers with this feature.\r\n\u2022 Charging Made Easy with EVgo Roaming Partners: Use our wide network, including partners like ChargePoint, with no additional accounts or hidden fees. Just find a charger and start charging!\r\n\r\n<b>Fast, Convenient Charging</b>\r\n\u2022 High-Power Charging: Charge your EV in minutes with chargers offering speeds up to 350 kW. Fast charging gets you back on the road quickly, ideal for both long trips and local commutes.\r\n\u2022 EVgo Autocharge+ Convenience: Enjoy the convenience of EVgo Autocharge+ for an effortless charging experience. Just plug in and charge\u2014no need for cards, apps, or extra taps.\r\n\u2022 Personalized Charging Experience: Filter search results by your vehicle's compatible connector and save your preferences for an optimized charging experience every time.\r\n\r\n<b>Additional Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Quick, Secure Login: Access your EVgo account easily via phone number or email for instant access to your favorite chargers.\r\n\u2022 Detailed Charging Information: Get detailed insights into pricing, parking, and charger-specific features so you know exactly what to expect at each location.\r\n\u2022 Subscription Plans for Discounts: Join an EVgo subscription plan to enjoy lower charging rates and special offers on fast charging.\r\n\r\n<b>Compatible with All EVs:</b>\r\nEVgo\u2019s charging network is compatible with all electric vehicles, offering CHAdeMO, CCS Combo, and Tesla connectors. Whether you drive a Tesla, BMW, Chevrolet, Hyundai, or any other electric vehicle, EVgo makes it easy to find an EV charger near you:\r\n\u2022Tesla Model X, Y, S, and 3\r\n\u2022BMW i3, i4, i5, i7, and iX\r\n\u2022Chevrolet Bolt EV, Bolt EUV, Blazer, Equinox, and Silverado\r\n\u2022Cadillac Lyric\r\n\u2022Hyundai Ioniq, Ioniq 5, Ioniq 6, Kona\r\n\u2022Mercedes- Benz EQS, EQB, EQE, EQS SUV\r\n\u2022Acura ZDX\r\n\u2022Audi e-tron GT, Q4 e-tron, Q8 e-tron\r\n\u2022Ford Mustang Mach-e, F150 Lightning\r\n\u2022Genesis GV60, GV70, G80\r\n\u2022GMC Hummer EV, Sierra\r\n\u2022Honda Prologue and Clarity\r\n\u2022Fisker Ocean\r\n\u2022Jaguar I-Pace\r\n\u2022Kia EV6, EV9, and Niro\r\n\u2022Lexus RZ\r\n\u2022Lordstown Endurance\r\n\u2022Lucid Air\r\n\u2022Mazda MX-30\r\n\u2022Mini Cooper Electric\r\n\u2022Nissan LEAF and ARIYA\r\n\u2022Polestar 2, 3\r\n\u2022Porsche Taycan\r\n\u2022Rivian R1T, R1S\r\n\u2022Subaru Solterra\r\n\u2022Toyota bZ4X\r\n\u2022Vinfast VF8, VF9\r\n\u2022Volkswagen ID. 4, ID. Buzz\r\n\u2022Volvo C40, EX30, EX90, and XC40\r\n\r\n<b>Why Choose EVgo?</b>\r\n\u2022 Extensive Network: Find over 1,000+ EV chargers nationwide across 35 states.\r\n\u2022 Fast & Convenient: High-power fast charging up to 350 kW for quicker stops.\r\n\u2022 Roaming Options: Seamlessly charge using other networks like ChargePoint.\r\n\u2022 User-Friendly: Real-time station availability, custom filters, and easy-to-use features for a smooth charging experience.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Find a Fast EV Charger with EVgo</b><br>Finding a charger has never been easier! With the EVgo app, you can find over 1,000 fast charging stations across 35 states. Whether you&#39;re at home, work, or on the go, the EVgo app helps you find EV chargers near you, get real-time availability, and access directions\u2014all in just a few taps. Join more than 1 million drivers who trust EVgo for fast, reliable electric vehicle (EV) charging, anytime and anywhere.<br><br><b>Key Features:</b><br>\u2022 Find EV Charging Stations Near You: Easily find the nearest EV chargers with our interactive EV charging map. Whether you&#39;re looking for a Tesla, CCS Combo, or CHAdeMO connectors, EVgo\u2019s public charging network has a charger for your vehicle.<br>\u2022 Real-Time Charger Availability: Save time by checking the real-time availability of charging stations before you arrive.<br>\u2022 Get Directions: The EVgo app seamlessly integrates with your favorite navigation apps, allowing you to get step-by-step directions to your selected charging station.<br>\u2022 Filter by Connector Type &amp; Charging Speed: Searching for a specific charger type? Filter results by connector type (Tesla, CHAdeMO, CCS) and charging speed to find the right charger for your EV.<br>\u2022 Reserve Your Charger: In select locations, you can even reserve your charging spot ahead of time, ensuring that a charger will be waiting for you when you arrive. Use the EVgo app to find chargers with this feature.<br>\u2022 Charging Made Easy with EVgo Roaming Partners: Use our wide network, including partners like ChargePoint, with no additional accounts or hidden fees. Just find a charger and start charging!<br><br><b>Fast, Convenient Charging</b><br>\u2022 High-Power Charging: Charge your EV in minutes with chargers offering speeds up to 350 kW. Fast charging gets you back on the road quickly, ideal for both long trips and local commutes.<br>\u2022 EVgo Autocharge+ Convenience: En