C40, EX30, EX90, and XC40<br><br><b>Why Choose EVgo?</b><br>\u2022 Extensive Network: Find over 1,000+ EV chargers nationwide across 35 states.<br>\u2022 Fast &amp; Convenient: High-power fast charging up to 350 kW for quicker stops.<br>\u2022 Roaming Options: Seamlessly charge using other networks like ChargePoint.<br>\u2022 User-Friendly: Real-time station availability, custom filters, and easy-to-use features for a smooth charging experience.",
